dist
out
coverage
**/.tanstack
**/.vite
.playwright-cli

# Agent/tool session state; .claude also holds throwaway worktrees whose
# copies of the repo would otherwise be scanned as source.
.claude
.pnpm-store
.serena
.impeccable

# Local e2e/perf run output — already git-ignored, but prettier reads the disk,
# so a perf run would otherwise fail `pnpm lint` for whoever ran it.
apps/web/e2e/perf/generated
apps/web/e2e/.artifacts

# Generated artifacts: the router's file-based route tree, drizzle's migration
# output (SQL + its journal), and anything else emitted as `*.gen.*`.
**/routeTree.gen.ts
packages/persistence/drizzle
**/*.gen.*

# Resolver-owned; reformatting it would churn a 268 KB file on every install.
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Frozen pre-implementation design reference, not maintained source.
mockup

# Markdown is prose, not source, and prettier's markdown printer is not safe
# on this doc set: it rewrote `**lychee link-check on `docs/**` adopted**`
# into `**lychee link-check on `docs/**`adopted**`, moving a word out of the
# emphasis span. Docs are hand-wrapped (proseWrap: preserve keeps them that
# way), so the check buys layout nothing and risks meaning.
**/*.md
